Frame md5 identical across all three arms, t = 1/2/4/8/16, both depths: 30 of 30
  (a00c11f454328023c58af14d55544cff / 4f218411bc6ee4cc9c630fe827337fa2).
Four new MECHANISM tests (the choice is invisible in the pixels AND in the
  tracker's record, so only a `#[cfg(test)]` branch counter can see it), teeth
  proved by three mutations, each restored byte-exact by sha256:
    for_rows_mut un-gated -> picture OFF half FAILS
    rectangle deleted     -> picture ON half FAILS
    fill_hull un-gated    -> loopfilter OFF half FAILS  (and, before the
